WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
In the past, when they caught people, they would kill them on the spot and then leave after venting their anger.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,840
But now I see through the telescope

3
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:08,080
It seems like they kept the people they caught in captivity.

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:10,080
Locked in chains for daily use

5
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:13,080
Can Jiaosheng is getting weaker and weaker intermittently from morning to night. It’s so scary.

6
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,680
This is more terrifying than killing directly

7
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:21,160
You are a college student, a junior in college

8
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:24,160
Senior year, I was supposed to graduate soon

9
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,930
I look like Jiang. Where are you from?

10
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:30,800
That's a coincidence. I can't hide from you next door.

11
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,520
This guy who also escaped from Jihu Villa cannot be kept

12
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:37,440
Once you give up the way to clear water, I will kill Li Wei'an

13
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:42,330
At least not now

14
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:45,130
Is there anyone really helping me today?

15
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:47,210
Yeah, I helped charge my phone.

16
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:49,890
I also poured the wine out of the bottle.

17
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:50,850
So awesome

18
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:53,480
Let’s test our mediocrity, okay?
